    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d402">

                <pb facs="0448" n="1182" xml:id="pg1182"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Taylor.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-04-16"><hi rendition="#italic">April 16,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>A month having elapsed since yon communicated to the Spanish Government the
                    representations of this Government touching the firing upon the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Alliança</hi> on the high sea off Cape Maysi while
                    innocently sailing under the American flag, the President deprecates further
                    delay in responding to our just expectations. This Government has given due
                    weight to the serious situation in Spain and Cuba, but the evidence appears to
                    so clearly establish that the act complained of was indefensible, if not wanton,
                    that delay is not understood.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
